      "writtenOn": "2026-10-16T20:40:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Do we want to call that out here? I think what is important for Gerrit operators to know is that you can downgrade and that there is a path forward. If I\u0027m considering a downgrade I\u0027m already probably having a worse outage than I anticipated and trying to sort out conditions like whether or not any changes got modified in that window is mental overhead that may not be worthwhile.",
      "parentUuid": "273fb246_1b70f62e",
      "revId": "c3668a77d0b41013c712afdb5e687cdcd6574c65",
      "serverId": "173816e5-2b9a-37c3-8a2e-48639d4f1153"
